## 2. Reconciled External Work ($W_{\text{trap}}$) Accounting

A rigorous point-by-point audit was performed to resolve the external work accounting:

1. **Authoritative Integration Source:**
   - Source Files: `M2CORR_H1_FREEU2_FULL_U050.dat` (Job `1389686.mmaster02`), `M2_H1_reference.dat` (Job `1408543.mmaster02`), and `M2_adapt_prod.dat` (Job `1408555.mmaster02`).
   - Reference Nodes: Node 12383 ($H_1$), Node 34509 ($H_2$), Node 7920 (Adaptive).
   - Columns: Displacement $u_1$ (Column 2) and Reaction Force $RF_1$ (Column 3).
2. **Mathematical Evaluation:**
   - Standard Trapezoidal Rule:
     $$W_{\text{trap}} = \sum_{k=1}^{N-1} \frac{RF_1^{(k)} + RF_1^{(k+1)}}{2} \left( u_1^{(k+1)} - u_1^{(k)} \right)$$
   - Full $H_1$ response ($0 \to 0.0500\text{ mm}$, 144 increments):
     $$W_{\text{trap}}(H_1) = 0.002732851\text{ kN}\cdot\text{mm} = 2.732851\text{ mJ}$$
   - Full Adaptive response ($0 \to 0.0500\text{ mm}$, 358 increments):
     $$W_{\text{trap}}(\text{Adaptive}) = 0.002041030\text{ kN}\cdot\text{mm} = 2.041030\text{ mJ}$$
   - Matched common interval comparison up to $u_1 = 0.04258\text{ mm}$:
     - $W_{\text{trap}}(H_1) = 2.6511\text{ mJ}$
     - $W_{\text{trap}}(H_2) = 2.6340\text{ mJ}$ ($\Delta = -0.65\%$)
     - $W_{\text{trap}}(\text{Adaptive}) = 1.9951\text{ mJ}$ ($\Delta = -24.7\%$, reflecting sharper localized post-peak softening).

