## 7. Machine-Verified Single-Factor Spatial Refinement Ledger ($H_1$ vs $H_2$)

A line-by-line machine comparison between $H_1$ ([`M2_H1_reference.inp`](file:///D:/Master%20thesis/Adaptive%20remeshing/models/pandey_kumar_mode2/02_reference_h1/M2_H1_reference.inp)) and $H_2$ ([`M2_H2_reference.inp`](file:///D:/Master%20thesis/Adaptive%20remeshing/models/pandey_kumar_mode2/03_ultrafine_h2/M2_H2_reference.inp)) establishes single-factor spatial refinement fidelity:

| Feature / Domain Parameter | $H_1$ Model (`02_reference_h1`) | $H_2$ Model (`03_ultrafine_h2`) | Equivalence / Difference Status |
